# ---- EarthGame2 ----
# Layout: Engine/ (engine-free .NET packages + tests), Unity/ (the Unity project), Tools/ (Python),
# Data/ (fetched datasets, not committed except fixtures), Saves/ (worlds), Docs/.

# Unity project (under Unity/)
Unity/[Ll]ibrary/
Unity/[Tt]emp/
Unity/[Oo]bj/
Unity/[Bb]uild/
Unity/[Bb]uilds/
Unity/[Ll]ogs/
Unity/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
Unity/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/
Unity/[Rr]ecordings/
Unity/.vs/
Unity/.idea/
Unity/*.csproj
Unity/*.sln
Unity/*.suo
Unity/*.user
Unity/*.userprefs
Unity/*.pidb
Unity/*.booproj
Unity/*.svd
Unity/*.pdb
Unity/*.mdb
Unity/*.opendb
Unity/*.VC.db
